<title>FINLAND: FINNAIR JULY PASSENGER LOAD FACTOR. [Corrected 13:12 gmt]</title>
<headline>FINNAIR JULY PASSENGER LOAD FACTOR. [Corrected 13:12 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national carrier Finnair Oy said in a statement on Monday its passenger load factor fell 0.7 (corrects from 1.4) percentage points year-on-year to 75.1 (corrects from 76.4) percent in July.</p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>				    July 1996    June 1996   Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     528	   571	 +10.7</p>
<p> RPK (million)			 997	   981	  +1.0</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 110	   107	  +0.9</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  4,911	 5,132	  +0.2</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    75.1	  73.2	  -0.7 pts</p>
<p>July 1996 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 295	 718	  85	    4,423</p>
<p> Domestic		147	  66	   6		394</p>
<p> Charter		  86	 213	  19		 95</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>				 July 1996   June 1996  Yr/yr (pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  72.1	 70.8	  -3.6</p>
<p> Domestic			 64.9	 58.8	 +14.7</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31.</p>
<p>RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried</p>
<p>multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried --</p>
<p>passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown.</p>
<p>Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available</p>
<p>seat km</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
